    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;border-right:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\"><div dir=\"rtl\">שלום לכולם<div><br></div><div>לאחר חיפוש ממושך, האם מישהו יודע כיצד ניתן (בתוך R Markdown):</div>\r\n\r\n<div>1. ליישר משוואות למשאל <br></div><div>2. להכניס תת-מספור למשוואות</div><div>הנה דוגמה לתוצר הרצוי שנעשה בWORD (רחמנא לצלן)</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-lOJ53PuD9vg/U1jWlf1CIfI/AAAAAAAAHUw/FEXj7NOHfJk/s1600/eq_in_word.JPG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-lOJ53PuD9vg/U1jWlf1CIfI/AAAAAAAAHUw/FEXj7NOHfJk/s1600/eq_in_word.JPG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792498023843000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1BvVivzN8aizMWjQtvVhGK\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-lOJ53PuD9vg/U1jWlf1CIfI/AAAAAAAAHUw/FEXj7NOHfJk/s320/eq_in_word.JPG\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"126\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<div>והנה הקוד שנערך ב-R (קובץ md.)<br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"direction:ltr\"><div style=\"direction:ltr\">Subtitle: Home assignment no. 5  </div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">  </div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">========================================================</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">1. Compute the following expressions:</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">$$ </div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">\\begin{aligned} </div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">\\begin{equation}</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">\\frac{2-i}{3+4i} = \\frac{(2-i)(3-4i)}{(3+4i)(3-4i)} = \\frac{6-3i-8i+4i^2}{3^2+4^2} = \\frac{2-11i}{25} = \\frac{2}{25} - \\frac{11}{25} i \\\\</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">\r\n\r\n<br></div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">\\exp{(3 + \\frac{\\pi}{4} i)} \\\\</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">\\end{equation}</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">\\end{aligned}</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">\r\n\r\n$$</div><div><br></div><div style=\"direction:rtl\">ברכות לעונים.</div><div style=\"direction:rtl\">הראל</div></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;border-right:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\"><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Israel R User Group&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-user-g...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n\r\n\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792498023843000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1MjuzHOe4Yk9HJGhpXJiZS\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</font></span></blockquote></div><br><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br>Jonathan Rosenblatt<br><a href=\"http://www.john-ros.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.john-ros.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792498023843000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2v8d5AzF0jHQ4y7_VUXhj2\">www.john-ros.com</a><br><br>\r\n</div>\r\n"
